column28:
*Issue:* AlServiceAccessPoint constructor invocation results in socket connection failure. Tried the paths "/tmp/al_em_ctrl_data_socket" and "/tmp/al_em_ctrl_control_socket" as inputs. Though the BPI device had the files present in the '/tmp' directory, socket failure happened.

{*}Unit test code which failed:{*}{*}{*}
 
{noformat}
class AlServiceAccessPointTest : public ::testing::Test {
protected:
     AlServiceAccessPoint * serviceAccessPoint;     
     void SetUp() override {
         serviceAccessPoint = new AlServiceAccessPoint("/tmp/al_em_ctrl_data_socket","/tmp/al_em_ctrl_control_socket");
}
     void TearDown() override {
         if (serviceAccessPoint != nullptr) {
             delete serviceAccessPoint;
             serviceAccessPoint = nullptr;
         }
     }
 };{noformat}
 
 

 

*Error logs:*

On invoking the AlServiceAccessPoint constructor with the socket paths "/tmp/al_em_ctrl_data_socket" and "/tmp/al_em_ctrl_control_socket" results in socket connection failure. Please find the attached logs:

 
{noformat}
